{"type":"message","id":"888c2ea8","parentId":"0619d1b3","timestamp":"2026-03-13T00:29:53.451Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"设计文档中提到了样式表目录，现在创建 assets/styles 目录下的默认 QSS 样式文件来完善项目结构。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_16c4e7d9028c47cdb62c93e7","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"/* Todo Calendar - 全局样式表 */\n\n/* 主窗口 */\nQMainWindow {\n    background-color: #f8f9fa;\n}\n\n/* 菜单栏 */\nQMenuBar {\n    background-color: #ffffff;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #dee2e6;\n    padding: 4px;\n}\n\nQMenuBar::item:selected {\n    background-color: #e9ecef;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n/* 状态栏 */\nQStatusBar {\n    background-color: #ffffff;\n    border-top: 1px solid #dee2e6;\n    color: #6c757d;\n}\n\n/* 按钮通用样式 */\nQPushButton {\n    background-color: #3498db;\n    color: white;\n    border: none;\n    padding: 8px 16px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n}\n\nQPushButton:hover {\n    background-color: #2980b9;\n}\n\nQPushButton:pressed {\n    background-color: #21618c;\n}\n\nQPushButton:disabled {\n    background-color: #bdc3c7;\n}\n\n/* 次要按钮 */\nQPushButton#secondary {\n    background-color: #95a5a6;\n}\n\nQPushButton#secondary:hover {\n    background-color: #7f8c8d;\n}\n\n/* 输入框 */\nQLineEdit, QTextEdit {\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    padding: 6px;\n    background-color: white;\n    font-size: 13px;\n}\n\nQLineEdit:focus, QTextEdit:focus {\n    border: 1px solid #3498db;\n}\n\n/* 下拉框 */\nQComboBox {\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    padding: 6px;\n    background-color: white;\n}\n\nQComboBox::drop-down {\n    border: none;\n    width: 20px;\n}\n\nQComboBox::down-arrow {\n    image: none;\n    border-left: 5px solid transparent;\n    border-right: 5px solid transparent;\n    border-top: 5px solid #666;\n    margin-right: 8px;\n}\n\n/* 日历表格 */\nQTableWidget {\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n    border-radius: 5px;\n    background-color: white;\n    gridline-color: #e0e0e0;\n}\n\nQTableWidget::item {\n    padding: 5px;\n    border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n}\n\nQTableWidget::item:selected {\n    background-color: #3498db;\n    color: white;\n}\n\nQHeaderView::section {\n    background-color: #f8f9fa;\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n    padding: 8px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #495057;\n}\n\n/* 列表控件 */\nQListWidget {\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n    border-radius: 5px;\n    background-color: white;\n}\n\nQListWidget::item {\n    padding: 8px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\n}\n\nQListWidget::item:selected {\n    background-color: #e3f2fd;\n}\n\nQListWidget::item:hover {\n    background-color: #f5f5f5;\n}\n\n/* 分割器 */\nQSplitter::handle {\n    background-color: #dee2e6;\n    width: 4px;\n}\n\nQSplitter::handle:hover {\n    background-color: #adb5bd;\n}\n\n/* 分组框 */\nQGroupBox {\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n    border-radius: 5px;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    padding-top: 10px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n}\n\nQGroupBox::title {\n    subcontrol-origin: margin;\n    left: 10px;\n    padding: 0 5px;\n    color: #495057;\n}\n\n/* 复选框 */\nQCheckBox {\n    spacing: 8px;\n}\n\nQCheckBox::indicator {\n    width: 18px;\n    height: 18px;\n    border: 2px solid #3498db;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    background-color: white;\n}\n\nQCheckBox::indicator:checked {\n    background-color: #3498db;\n}\n\nQCheckBox::indicator:hover {\n    border: 2px solid #2980b9;\n}\n\n/* 标签 */\nQLabel {\n    color: #333;\n}\n\nQLabel#title {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #2c3e50;\n}\n\nQLabel#subtitle {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #7f8c8d;\n}\n\n/* 对话框 */\nQDialog {\n    background-color: #f8f9fa;\n}\n\n/* 工具提示 */\nQToolTip {\n    background-color: #2c3e50;\n    color: white;\n    border: none;\n    padding: 4px 8px;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n}\n\n/* 滚动条 */\nQScrollBar:vertical {\n    background-color: #f8f9fa;\n    width: 10px;\n    border-radius: 5px;\n}\n\nQScrollBar::handle:vertical {\n    background-color: #bdc3c7;\n    border-radius: 5px;\n    min-height: 20px;\n}\n\nQScrollBar::handle:vertical:hover {\n    background-color: #95a5a6;\n}\n\nQScrollBar::add-line:vertical,\nQScrollBar::sub-line:vertical {\n    height: 0px;\n}\n\nQScrollBar:horizontal {\n    background-color: #f8f9fa;\n    height: 10px;\n    border-radius: 5px;\n}\n\nQScrollBar::handle:horizontal {\n    background-color: #bdc3c7;\n    border-radius: 5px;\n    min-width: 20px;\n}\n\nQScrollBar::handle:horizontal:hover {\n    background-color: #95a5a6;\n}\n\nQScrollBar::add-line:horizontal,\nQScrollBar::sub-line:horizontal {\n    width: 0px;\n}\n","path":"/home/admin/.openclaw/workspace/todo-calendar/assets/styles/default.qss"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"dashscope-coding","model":"qwen3.5-plus","usage":{"input":40180,"output":1653,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41833,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773361780843}}
